  "note": "frozen is the unlearned hybrid: dense plus a 0.10 BM25 blend plus one hop from those seeds over the code graph. It is not the older PageRank walk. Learning modes store each fix before the next prediction. reweight is that memory plus edge reweighting. +shortcuts, +gap, and full add those operators on top. Memory threshold, k, recency, file and module priors, shortcut support, and credit decay were chosen on the last 20% of the training issues only. The holdout was scored once after that choice. slices splits the holdout into issues whose gold module or file already appeared in a training fix. Stronger memory weights, a lower similarity threshold, file and module priors, recency, a lower credit decay, earlier shortcuts, and a frontier gate were tried on the last 20% of training and did not clear the selection bar, so this holdout uses the previous hyperparameters. The validation curve in results/curve.json is that slice, not the holdout.",
